{{!
    @template theme_dimensions/competency_classreport_cell

    One cell of the class report: a learner's rating in one competency, linked to core's page of that learner's
    competency in the course (admin/tool/lp/user_competency_in_course.php), which is also where the cell leads
    without JavaScript.

    The rating's name sits in the status label of its proficiency (dim-comp-pill, as on the breakdown); the words
    carry the meaning: the proficiency follows in visually hidden text, which a screen reader and the download read;
    "Not rated" alone where there is no rating. The icon is decoration.

    The grading dialogue's hooks, the ones core's report_competency/grading_popup reads on its breakdown
    (data-user-competency="true", data-userid, data-competencyid, data-courseid), are written only for a viewer who
    may rate (hooks); theme_dimensions/classratings opens the dialogue from them. One line, so the download, which
    keeps the text and drops the tags, reads "Good Proficient".

    Context variables required for this template:
    * url - Core's page of the learner's competency in the course.
    * title - The link's title, core's "User competency summary".
    * hooks - Whether the viewer may rate here.
    * userid, competencyid, courseid - The hooks' values.
    * rated - Whether the learner has a rating.
    * tone - proficient or notproficient when rated.
    * icon - The Font Awesome glyph of the state.
    * label - The rating's name, or "Not rated"; plain.
    * state - Proficient or Not proficient, when rated; plain.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/lp/user_competency_in_course.php?courseid=2&competencyid=4&userid=3",
        "title": "User competency summary",
        "hooks": true,
        "userid": 3,
        "competencyid": 4,
        "courseid": 2,
        "rated": true,
        "tone": "proficient",
        "icon": "circle-check",
        "label": "Good",
        "state": "Proficient"
    }
}}
<a class="dim-comp-classreport__cell" href="{{url}}" title="{{title}}"{{#hooks}} data-user-competency="true" data-userid="{{userid}}" data-competencyid="{{competencyid}}" data-courseid="{{courseid}}"{{/hooks}}><span class="dim-comp-pill{{#rated}} dim-comp-pill--{{tone}}{{/rated}}"><i class="fa-solid fa-{{icon}} dim-comp-pill__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>{{label}}</span>{{#rated}} <span class="visually-hidden">{{state}}</span>{{/rated}}</a>
